@startuml
' Source Use Case: UC-020 — View Wardrobe Gaps
' Primary Specification: ../use-cases/UC-020-view-wardrobe-gaps.md
' Supporting Authorities: ../SRS.md (v0.3); ../business-rules.md (v0.1.2)
' Business/Product: ../../01-business/BRD.md (v0.3); ../../02-product/PRD.md (v0.2)
' Master Actors/Scope: ../use-cases/use-case-diagram.puml
' Process Authority: ../../../Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 11, 39–42, 46
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft
' SRS trace: FR-GAP-001, FR-GAP-002, FR-GAP-003, FR-GAP-004, FR-GAP-005, ERR-ANL-001, ERR-ANL-002, ERR-WEATHER-001
' Rule trace: BRULE-AUTH-001, BRULE-COV-002, BRULE-COV-005, BRULE-COV-006, BRULE-GAP-001, BRULE-GAP-002
' Flow coverage: UC Sections 6–10; alternatives and failures retain their textual meaning.
' The textual Use Case Specification remains the normative behavioral source.

title AD-020 - View Wardrobe Gaps
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

|User|
start
:Request wardrobe gap insights;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Authorized wardrobe/needs access usable?) then (Yes)
    :Identify wardrobe, positive priorities and context;
else (No)
    :Pause protected use; require renewed access (UC-002);
    stop
endif
:Obtain current Coverage basis and supporting evidence;
if (Relevant prior basis changed?) then (Yes)
    :Mark prior gap advice Outdated; attempt refresh;
endif
if (Current coverage basis/result available?) then (Yes)
else (Unavailable / unrefreshed)
    :Disclose unavailable evidence or prior Outdated basis;
    :Do not assert a defensible no-gap result;
    |User|
    :Retry after review/recovery or return to available context;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
if (Coverage evidence sufficient?) then (Yes)
else (Insufficient)
    :Explain missing assessment conditions;
    :Withhold unsupported gap and numeric-zero claims;
    |User|
    :Revise existing inputs and request analysis again when useful;
    stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Identify positive-priority needs below full NeedCoverage;
:Identify evidence-supported capability bottlenecks;
if (Important supported gap exists?) then (Yes)
    :Present underserved wardrobe capabilities;
else (No important gap)
    :Explain defensible no-important-gap result;
    |User|
    :Continue wardrobe/outfit insights without manufactured demand;
    stop
endif
|User|
:Select a gap to inspect;
|CapsuleAI|
:Explain need, bottleneck, context
and useful garment characteristics;
note right
  A capability gap is not one specific product.
  No mandatory purchase or ownership follows.
end note
if (Useful evaluable candidate available?) then (Yes)
    :Offer optional candidate/utility exploration;
else (No)
    :Retain supported gap; explain candidate limitation;
    |User|
    :Continue insights or revise existing inputs;
    stop
endif
|User|
if (Explore candidate advice?) then (Yes)
    :Continue to UC-021 or UC-022 as a separate goal;
else (Decline)
    :Continue owned-wardrobe insights without shopping;
endif
stop

@enduml
